+  // st.genesis = { committeeId, args: [salt, machine, Y, codeSet, identitySig, hostSig], confirmed }. Until the agreed chain
+  // shows that committee with this machine and key, every retry (after a failed or ambiguous submission, or a restart)
+  // re-sends the SAME transaction for the SAME share - never a new secret or committee. A read that cannot agree throws:
